"end": 223.11,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5163,
"char_end": 5214,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.11,
"end": 225.4,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5215,
"char_end": 5320,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.4,
"end": 226.65,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "We've seen this pattern in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5321,
"char_end": 5378,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 226.65,
"end": 228.0,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5379,
"char_end": 5441,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 228.0,
"end": 234.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 5459,
"char_end": 5476,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.0,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "And when teams adopt the Spoke & Wrench methodology within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5492,
"char_end": 5661,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 242.5,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 5679,
"char_end": 5719,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.5,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the version of the question that really matters?",
"char_start": 5720,
"char_end": 5776,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 246.56,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5792,
"char_end": 5812,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 246.56,
"end": 250.15,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the track sections influence the choice of trajectory between training sessions and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5813,
"char_end": 5941,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 250.15,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "Inês Carvalho",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5942,
"char_end": 6008,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6026,
"char_end": 6093,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 262.13,
